Output : URL - Business Entity - eu001-sp
             URL - SubSite - /sites/AAAAA0626</narrative><display x="-240" y="-165" w="270" h="60" /></stage><stage stageid="5eecc057-e040-412b-82db-d987ca74def3" name="Get Tenant ID" type="Action"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><narrative>Returns the value of the specified credentials property.

An Exception will occur if access to these credentials is not allowed (based on the running Resource, Process and User) or if the credentials do not contain a property with the specified name.</narrative><display x="15" y="-15" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Credentials Name" narrative="The name of the credentials" expr="[RPA_Sharepoint_Credential_Name]" /><input type="text" name="Property Name" narrative="The name of the property" expr="&quot;Tenant ID&quot;" /></inputs><outputs><output type="password" name="Property Value" narrative="The value of the property" stage="Tenant ID" /></outputs><onsuccess>16768ca3-97aa-4921-8a49-648f9d5a1917</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsCredentialsActions" action="Get Property" /></stage><stage stageid="16768ca3-97aa-4921-8a49-648f9d5a1917" name="Get Client ID" type="Action"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><narrative>Returns the value of the specified credentials property.

An Exception will occur if access to these credentials is not allowed (based on the running Resource, Process and User) or if the credentials do not contain a property with the specified name.</narrative><display x="15" y="30" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Credentials Name" narrative="The name of the credentials" expr="[RPA_Sharepoint_Credential_Name]" /><input type="text" name="Property Name" narrative="The name of the property" expr="&quot;Client ID&quot;" /></inputs><outputs><output type="password" name="Property Value" narrative="The value of the property" stage="Client ID" /></outputs><onsuccess>ff7a3fcc-fa3c-46aa-86dd-2995d6eb818b</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsCredentialsActions" action="Get Property" /></stage><stage stageid="ff7a3fcc-fa3c-46aa-86dd-2995d6eb818b" name="Get Client Secret Key" type="Action"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><narrative>Get the specified set of credentials.

An Exception will occur if access to the credentials is not allowed, based on the running Resource, Process and User.</narrative><display x="15" y="75" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Credentials Name" narrative="The name of the credentials to get" expr="[RPA_Sharepoint_Credential_Name]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="text" name="Username" narrative="The user name" stage="" /><output type="password" name="Password" narrative="The password" stage="Client_Secret" /><output type="date" name="Expiry Date" narrative="The expiry date" stage="" /><output type="text" name="Status" narrative="The status" stage="" /></outputs><onsuccess>dfa437f4-85aa-4467-914a-bfb7a7a5bdfa</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsCredentialsActions" action="Get" /></stage><stage stageid="9a5f5f29-b77a-4718-ac3f-fc3b3fbb2771" name="RPA_Sharepoint_Credential_Name" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="-45" w="150" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue xml:space="preserve">Sharepoint_API_Credential</initialvalue><exposure>Environment</exposure><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="3b78cd68-147d-44d3-8fb4-677c5174ae24" name="RPA_Sharepoint_URL" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="-15" w="150" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><exposure>Environment</exposure><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="7234031b-f113-46af-99af-afcb68c547c8" name="RPA_Sharepoint_Bearer_Token" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="15" w="150" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><exposure>Environment</exposure><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="ece318e4-71bf-4719-a07e-192799831e89" name="Client_Secret" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="180" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>password</datatype><initialvalueenc></initialvalueenc><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="08e76c58-6ed6-4592-9a34-c9f3ef4112ee" name="Tenant ID" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="120" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>password</datatype><initialvalueenc></initialvalueenc><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="805f5255-179a-4683-8e4f-2e118de70675" name="Client ID" type="Data"><subsheetid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="150" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>password</datatype><initialvalueenc></initialvalueenc><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="cbb7dacc-bb78-4137-833a-7175d6a10bcf" name="Get Sharepoint Credentials" type="SubSheet"><display x="105" y="-240" /><outputs><output type="password" name="Tenant ID" narrative="Tenant ID for Sharepoint" stage="Tenant ID" /><output type="password" name="Client ID" narrative="Client ID for Sharepoint" stage="Client ID" /><output type="password" name="Client Secret Key" narrative="Client Secret Ket for Sharepoint" stage="Client_Secret" /></outputs><onsuccess>84b10fc7-5a7e-4ade-b6c2-5fd94a5d7ef7</onsuccess><processid>6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182</processid></stage><stage stageid="12516427-beb7-4345-b8ee-e479db6f5795" name="Prepare Site Parameters" type="MultipleCalculation"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="15" y="165" w="120" h="30" /><onsuccess>4415b465-722e-4df2-ac66-cdb0b8124024</onsuccess><steps><calculation expression="[Client ID]&amp;&quot;@&quot;&amp;[Tenant ID]" stage="Sharepoint App Client ID" /><calculation expression="&quot;00000003-0000-0ff1-ce00-000000000000/&quot;&amp;[URL - Business Entity]&amp;&quot;.shell.com@&quot;&amp;[Tenant ID]" stage="Resource" /></steps></stage><stage stageid="3998ac0b-898f-4c1b-9bd5-5547f351c54a" name="Anchor6" type="Anchor"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="150" y="135" w="10" h="10" /><onsuccess>78bb24c0-ce31-49f1-a159-b81a000d2b4a</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="78bb24c0-ce31-49f1-a159-b81a000d2b4a" name="Anchor7" type="Anchor"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="15" y="135" w="10" h="10" /><onsuccess>12516427-beb7-4345-b8ee-e479db6f5795</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="b46ceec0-c051-4fde-b4dc-1e8243abe42b" name="Resource" type="Data"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="210" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="c9ebd312-5b15-46f1-9503-fa89b3ca26b7" name="Sharepoint App Client ID" type="Data"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><narrative>This is not the same as an Azure App ID. This is the client ID generated from the sharepoint admin screens</narrative><display x="-360" y="180" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="2444b701-fb04-43fe-92d9-f8f8c4e5055c" name="Client ID" type="Data"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="-15" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>password</datatype><initialvalueenc></initialvalueenc><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="74362798-b439-4fb1-a6d2-732627be3e3a" name="Tenant ID" type="Data"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="-45" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>password</datatype><initialvalueenc></initialvalueenc><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="ce2a9cfa-8547-4ec5-84a3-20802dc18646" name="Recover" type="Recover"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="-180" y="60" /><font family="Tahoma" size="10" style="Regular" color="000000" /><onsuccess>1dbf7a16-eab8-4cfa-b140-333500a689f7</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="1dbf7a16-eab8-4cfa-b140-333500a689f7" name="Exception" type="Exception"><subsheetid>38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1</subsheetid><display x="-180" y="135" /><exception localized="yes" type="" detail="" usecurrent="yes" /></stage><stage stageid="c6420cce-03e7-4e14-9c6d-732cf7480f42" name="URL Sub Site" type="Data"><subsheetid>28624cb7-7f33-4857-ba88-33aa31ce4220</subsheetid><display x="-450" y="150" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="d1572aeb-f751-4860-a174-f6873828973d" name="Folder Exists ?" type="Decision"><display x="105" y="-60" /><decision expression="[Folder Exists ?]" /><ontrue>4ab58101-973f-42d3-aab0-efe82d985353</ontrue><onfalse>3829b876-599d-4ff5-b0cb-6dc0b18b4a54</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="3829b876-599d-4ff5-b0cb-6dc0b18b4a54" name="Exception" type="Exception"><display x="195" y="-60" /><exception type="System Unavailable Exception" detail="&quot;Sharepoint API Utility &gt;&gt; API Error. Blueprism Exception : &quot; &amp;[Exception Detail] " /></stage><stage stageid="ffa86b27-bde2-4436-b48c-d96fdf3d7c85" name="Downloaded ?" type="Data"><display x="-360" y="165" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>flag</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="693be145-8b78-4805-996d-1fe497d4ee46" name="Download File - Processed Parameters" type="Block"><display x="-450" y="120" w="180" h="105" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Regular" color="7FB2E5" /></stage><stage stageid="df9f420d-e684-4867-8136-096767196628" name="Sharepoint_Folder_Path" type="Data"><display x="-570" y="-270" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="a589e265-afe1-4ede-9b97-286f795101bd" name="Input Parameters" type="Block"><display x="-645" y="-315" w="150" h="135" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Regular" color="7FB2E5" /></stage><stage stageid="e6ef3ac2-7731-4151-9017-be8afe1889f0" name="Config_File_Name" type="Data"><display x="-570" y="-240" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="9a85ba27-7c62-4cab-8e7d-714e64c9f72b" name="VM_Download_Path" type="Data"><display x="-570" y="-210" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="7dcb46be-fbf3-4c00-a0d9-cec157fc7dd1" name="Note" type="Note"><narrative>Tenant ID, Client ID and Client Secret key is derived from Blueprism credential manager.

Sharepoint URL is derived from Environment varibale - RPA_Sharepoint_URL

Sharepoint Bearer token is stored in credential manager -RPA_Sharepoint_Bearer_Token</narrative><display x="-300" y="-540" w="300" h="210" /></stage><stage stageid="f3ca92a0-5984-487e-9975-67f930665c5e" name="Example" type="Note"><narrative>Sharepoint Folder- eg. "/sites/AAFAA5234/RPAProjectDocument/"
Note that https://eu001-sp.shell.com/ is not used in folder path as it is automatically derived from Sharepoint URL.

Config File Name- eg - "config_PID_10_DS_ABC.xlsx"
Note that the Config file name has the file extension.

VM Download Path - eg. "C:\apps"
Config file will be downloaded to this path</narrative><display x="-630" y="-540" w="300" h="210" /></stage><stage stageid="c284eb34-fc19-4d20-a14f-4d0e3dcbeefa" name="VM File Name with Path" type="Calculation"><subsheetid>28624cb7-7f33-4857-ba88-33aa31ce4220</subsheetid><display x="30" y="135" /><onsuccess>74c51776-c8c3-4bfc-80f8-c16da40755c1</onsuccess><calculation expression="[VM_Path]&amp;[File_Name]" stage="VM File Name with Path" /></stage><stage stageid="f5b2ca46-3607-45ef-a180-3506610d7efd" name="VM File Name with Path" type="Data"><subsheetid>28624cb7-7f33-4857-ba88-33aa31ce4220</subsheetid><display x="-450" y="270" w="90" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="e87454d8-28a3-4081-96d1-3832d5bea490" name="File Name with Path" type="Data"><display x="-360" y="195" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="4ab58101-973f-42d3-aab0-efe82d985353" name="File Exists" type="SubSheet"><display x="105" y="-15" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Bearer Token Credetial Name" narrative="Credential Name for Bearer token" expr="[RPA_Sharepoint_Bearer_Token]" /><input type="text" name="Folder Path" narrative="Folder to check" expr="[Sharepoint_Folder_Path]&amp;[Config_File_Name]" /><input type="text" name="URL Business Entity" narrative="Business Entity URL obtained from Get URL Components action" expr="[URL - Business Entity]" /><input type="text" name="URL Subsite" narrative="Subsite URL obtained from Get URL Components action" expr="[URL - Subsite]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="flag" name="Folder Exists ?" narrative="Flag to check if Folder exists" stage="Config File Exists ?" /></outputs><onsuccess>d6c722f3-b213-4910-9f57-0b1e3f1c42f5</onsuccess><processid>4e9d820e-05ae-431b-9274-f250e2e8d849</processid></stage><stage stageid="d6c722f3-b213-4910-9f57-0b1e3f1c42f5" name="File Exists ?" type="Decision"><display x="105" y="30" /><decision expres