52dc</subsheetid><display x="-600" y="0" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="9e260e29-171b-4b38-99f8-ebdc1f3d4109" name="SP_Site_URL" type="Data"><subsheetid>4de6d347-f4ab-41f1-8684-bf01a35d52dc</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="-105" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="015d90d5-18d4-457f-9086-7162d62d3176" name="Sp_Lib_Folder" type="Data"><subsheetid>4de6d347-f4ab-41f1-8684-bf01a35d52dc</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="-75" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="baa403ec-6819-465c-8ab4-d61109ed917b" name="Dest_Directory" type="Data"><subsheetid>4de6d347-f4ab-41f1-8684-bf01a35d52dc</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="-45" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="222e27de-6ba2-4339-8ba1-e007621d8611" name="Standards" type="Note"><subsheetid>4de6d347-f4ab-41f1-8684-bf01a35d52dc</subsheetid><narrative>Dest_Directory: destination directory where the file will be downloadedC:\Apps

Create_Dir:- To check if Directory is not there whether to create or not.

Share_Lib_File_Path: Includes Library and sub folder ( Example:- Documents/FO/Data)

SP_Site_URL: Sharepoint Site or subsite URL(Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)

File Format :  What type of the file you ar etrying to downlaod . Ex .xlsx/.xls etc



