File Name:- File to be Deleted (Example:- test.xlsx)

Share_Target_Lib: Includes Library and sub folder where to search file present or not( Example:- Documents/FO/Data)

SP_Site_URL: Sharepoint Site or subsite URL(Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)

************************************************************************************************
Considering to delete "Test.xlsx" in   "https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201/Documents/FO/Data".
</narrative><display x="-315" y="-165" w="300" h="150" /></stage><stage stageid="2781ba3d-e5d3-4914-8075-ba674e8df7a0" name="Unexpected exception recover" type="Recover"><subsheetid>08319810-b5ba-48cb-830d-5f64c987a2b9</subsheetid><display x="480" y="-45" /><onsuccess>37a10d60-849e-4b77-aa94-a511a42e2284</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="cc3dc97d-6098-4f43-9f5a-ac19184a2023" name="Unexpected Exception" type="Exception"><subsheetid>08319810-b5ba-48cb-830d-5f64c987a2b9</subsheetid><display x="690" y="-45" /><exception localized="yes" type="" detail="" usecurrent="yes" /></stage><stage stageid="83610e34-62bc-461e-9a93-8b643f1a5c74" name="Script_Location" type="Data"><subsheetid>08319810-b5ba-48cb-830d-5f64c987a2b9</subsheetid><display x="-60" y="-15" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="37a10d60-849e-4b77-aa94-a511a42e2284" name="Delete_Script" type="Action"><subsheetid>08319810-b5ba-48cb-830d-5f64c987a2b9</subsheetid><display x="585" y="-45" /><inputs><input type="text" name="File Name" narrative="The full path to the file to delete" expr="[Script Path]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="flag" name="Success" narrative="True if successful" stage="" /><output type="text" name="Message" narrative="An error message if unsuccessful" stage="" /></outputs><onsuccess>cc3dc97d-6098-4f43-9f5a-ac19184a2023</onsuccess><resource object="Utility - File Management" action="Delete File" /></stage><stage stageid="f414daff-7403-4e27-9a32-0311325a3104" name="Export List to CSV by Columns" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><narrative>Exports provided columns of given list to a csv file</narrative><display x="-600" y="-120" w="150" h="90" /></stage><stage stageid="a13a44b2-c93e-49bc-a813-3cea5dfb293d" name="Return Message" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-435" y="345" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="eb1120ee-3cfc-44e2-a848-1de3d147c9a4" name="Script" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-600" y="0" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="67749b9d-3141-448e-9de2-8c531fb1a1e6" name="SP_Site_URL" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="45" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="30b1384b-5bcd-44cf-8cc7-8997df4f9a3d" name="Dest_Directory" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="90" w="120" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="338e1eb4-816d-4f55-84f7-abb6c35ba5aa" name="Standards" type="Note"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><narrative>Dest_Directory: destination directory where the file will be downloaded e.g. C:\Apps

Create_Dir:- To check if Directory is not there whether to create or not.

SP_List: name of the list to be exported.

Column_IDs: List of column IDs to be exported. Should be provided as text enclosed in apostrophe and separated by comma e.g. 'Title','Created By'

SP_Site_URL: Sharepoint Site or subsite URL(Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)

CSV File name: Filename of the csv where the list is to be exported
</narrative><display x="-525" y="-285" w="300" h="150" /></stage><stage stageid="89a37263-5b82-485a-97b8-7790d0e2df00" name="Unexpected exception recover" type="Recover"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="180" y="-180" /><onsuccess>5037bb6e-72f5-4ac3-8295-f210398c6244</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="4f14cfe1-019a-461c-bba8-563638ef8275" name="Unexpected Exception" type="Exception"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="390" y="-180" /><exception localized="yes" type="" detail="" usecurrent="yes" savescreencapture="yes" /></stage><stage stageid="ec467536-8e80-4af2-b7d4-b33b3d57a608" name="IsDirExist" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-600" y="-30" /><datatype>flag</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="91b0d0b7-a57a-4eea-86c0-0e8eb8ce7ee3" name="Script Path" type="Data"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-600" y="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="eab48703-87dd-49f9-a8e4-4d43f4926f06" name="Start" type="Start"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="-495" /><inputs><input type="text" name="SharePoint Site URL" narrative="SharePoint Site/ Subsite URL (Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)" stage="SP_Site_URL" /><input type="text" name="SP_List" narrative="Name of Sharepoint list to be exported." stage="SP_List" /><input type="text" name="Destination" narrative="Folder Location to download(Ex:- C:\Apps\PID1)" stage="Dest_Directory" /><input type="flag" name="Create_Dir" narrative="If Dir is not there Bot to create?" stage="Create_Dir" /><input type="text" name="ScriptLocation" narrative="(Optional)Temp script store location(Ex: C:\Apps) ( In case of not provided any value, default location will be C:\Users\&lt;UserNm&gt;\Documnets)" stage="ScriptLocation" /><input type="text" name="Filename" narrative="CSV filename to export the list to" stage="CSV Filename" /><input type="text" name="Columns" narrative="Columns to be exported provided as a text values separated by comma e.g. 'Title','Created Date'" stage="Columns" /><input type="text" name="TimeOut" narrative="(Optional) Maximum time allowed for Powershell execution, post which BluePrism gets control" stage="TimeOut" /></inputs><onsuccess>6dc96ecc-31d4-47f0-86b6-42955737b799</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="4838b607-3cde-4106-bfab-1cb916d57d1f" name="End" type="End"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="240" /><outputs><output type="text" name="Script_Run_Message" narrative="Returns run report( On success returns nothing)" stage="Return Message" /><output type="text" name="Script_Error_Message" narrative="Return error/exception details( On error Share error details)" stage="Error_Message" /></outputs></stage><stage stageid="8cc4b2d9-20b6-4c3b-a89e-6d83fd7b42e7" name="Build Script" type="Calculation"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="-240" /><onsuccess>cf0c2a7e-7bd3-40f7-807f-a20b21b2b205</onsuccess><calculation expression="&quot;$env:PNPPOWERSHELL_UPDATECHECK=&quot;&amp;Chr(34)&amp;&quot;false&quot;&amp;Chr(34)&amp;&quot;&quot;&amp;NewLine()&amp;&quot;&#xA;Connect-PnPOnline -Url &quot;&amp; Chr(34) &amp; [SP_Site_URL] &amp; Chr(34)  &amp;&quot; -AccessToken &quot; &amp;[AccessToken] &amp;&quot; -WarningAction SilentlyContinue&quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp; &quot;$listContent = Get-PnPListItem -List &quot; &amp; Chr(34) &amp; [SP_List] &amp; Chr(34) &amp; &quot;-Fields &quot; &amp; [Columns] &amp;&quot;-Pagesize 500&quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp; &quot;$columnsToRetrieve = &quot; &amp; [Columns] &amp; NewLine() &amp; &quot;$filePath =&quot;&amp;Chr(34) &amp; [Dest_Directory]&amp; &quot;\&quot; &amp; [CSV Filename] &amp; Chr(34) &amp; NewLine() &amp; NewLine() &amp;  &quot;If (Test-Path($filePath )){&quot; &amp; NewLine() &amp; &#xA;    &quot;Remove-Item $filePath &#xA;}&quot;&#xA;&amp; NewLine() &amp; NewLine() &amp;&#xA;&quot;Foreach ($column in $columnsToRetrieve){ &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;    $column + &quot;&amp; Chr(34) &amp; Chr(44)&amp; Chr(34) &amp; &quot;| Add-Content -Path $filePath -NoNewline &quot; &amp;NewLine() &amp; &quot;&#xA;}&quot; &amp;NewLine() &amp; Chr(34) &amp; Chr(34) &amp; &quot;  | Add-Content -Path $filePath &#xA;&quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp; NewLine() &amp; &quot;&#xA;Foreach ($item in $ListContent){ &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;    Foreach ($column in $columnsToRetrieve){ &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;       [string] $item[$column] + &quot;&amp; Chr(34) &amp; Chr(44)&amp; Chr(34) &amp; &quot; | Add-Content -Path $filePath -NoNewline &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;    } &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;    &quot;&amp; Chr(34) &amp; Chr(34) &amp; &quot; | Add-Content -Path $filePath &quot;&amp; NewLine() &amp;&quot;&#xA;}&quot;&#xA;" stage="Script" /></stage><stage stageid="a320d5cd-6c26-446c-b9e6-53208d5041f4" name="Run PnP_Script" type="SubSheet"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="-30" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Application" narrative="Application.exe" expr="[Application_nm] &amp; &quot;.exe&quot;" /><input type="text" name="Script_Path" narrative="Script Location" expr="[Script Path]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="text" name="Run Report" narrative="Return  run report From Power Shell" stage="Return Message" /><output type="text" name="Error_Message" narrative="return failure/error message" stage="Error_Message" /></outputs><onsuccess>ee467597-5d80-43fe-8b01-8c6c5e56d847</onsuccess><processid>7c20ffe9-31ed-4311-8f74-2fdb02423ff3</processid></stage><stage stageid="8d8e1141-0cc7-4466-9a9e-9db3f43a777b" name="Delete_Script" type="Action"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="180" /><inputs><input type="text" name="File Name" narrative="The full path to the file to delete" expr="[Script Path]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="flag" name="Success" narrative="True if successful" stage="" /><output type="text" name="Message" narrative="An error message if unsuccessful" stage="" /></outputs><onsuccess>4838b607-3cde-4106-bfab-1cb916d57d1f</onsuccess><resource object="Utility - File Management" action="Delete File" /></stage><stage stageid="cf0c2a7e-7bd3-40f7-807f-a20b21b2b205" name="Generate_PnPScript" type="SubSheet"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="-195" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Script_Content" narrative="Content of the script" expr="[Script]" /><input type="text" name="Script_Name" narrative="Name Of the script" expr="&quot;Temp_download&quot;" /><input type="text" name="Script_location" narrative="Directory where to stor ethe script" expr="[ScriptLocation]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="text" name="Script_Path" stage="Script Path" /><output type="text" name="Status_Message" stage="Return Message" /></outputs><onsuccess>92dc5c71-5492-4cb6-b27b-1fa3f563eae7</onsuccess><processid>7da6c534-513c-499b-ad78-ecf5fb9a01a5</processid></stage><stage stageid="92dc5c71-5492-4cb6-b27b-1fa3f563eae7" name="Check_Error" type="Decision"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="-165" y="-150" /><decision expression="Len([Return Message]) &gt;0" /><ontrue>4bdc7a26-a87b-4a43-9453-d0c0f396dd70</ontrue><onfalse>bdabacf3-2403-4b32-9720-7e5d39ddd17e</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="4bdc7a26-a87b-4a43-9453-d0c0f396dd70" name="Exception while creating  Script" type="Exception"><subsheetid>56008328-fdd9-441a-afe4-a6ec51310048</subsheetid><display x="75" y="-150" /><exception type="System Exception" detail="[Return Message]" savescreencapture="yes" /></stage><stage stageid="ee467597-5d80-43fe-8b01-8c6c5e56d847" name="Check Process_Exist" type="Action"><subsheetid>56008328-fd