s" type="Data"><subsheetid>ea8c5e80-4adc-491a-9271-ea53ea8fc489</subsheetid><narrative>Process exist or not</narrative><display x="-405" y="180" /><datatype>flag</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="09d2cc48-1fe0-470d-b684-7385ebfc860c" name="File_Type" type="Data"><subsheetid>ea8c5e80-4adc-491a-9271-ea53ea8fc489</subsheetid><display x="-360" y="0" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue xml:space="preserve">Item</initialvalue><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="450d340d-e566-4f34-806a-e299e550c1bc" name="Standards" type="Note"><subsheetid>ea8c5e80-4adc-491a-9271-ea53ea8fc489</subsheetid><narrative>Check if a particular folder exists

SP_Site_URL: Sharepoint Site or subsite URL(Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)
Folder Name: The name of the folder that has to be searched in the SP link




