fa" name="Script" type="Data"><subsheetid>1af354b2-6d32-487d-aad6-8ee913f9f220</subsheetid><display x="-600" y="0" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="6ef73aed-25b6-4fb2-b55c-373588d1d706" name="SP_Site_URL" type="Data"><subsheetid>1af354b2-6d32-487d-aad6-8ee913f9f220</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="-90" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="85a3a525-9ffa-472e-a9bf-d60b7c890bc6" name="Standards" type="Note"><subsheetid>1af354b2-6d32-487d-aad6-8ee913f9f220</subsheetid><narrative>Dest_Directory: destination directory where the file will be downloadedC:\Apps

Create_Dir:- To check if Directory is not there whether to create or not.

Share_Lib_File_Path: Includes Library and sub folder ( Example:- Documents/FO/Data/Test.xlsx)

SP_Site_URL: Sharepoint Site or subsite URL(Example:- https://eu001-sp.shell.com/sites/AAAAA3201)

************************************************************************************************
